---
/*
 * chart-alternatives - chart-builder review page.
 *
 * Not linked from production navigation. URL-accessed only:
 *   /chart-alternatives
 *
 * Renders all alternative chart treatments authored under
 * src/components/charts/_alternatives/<section>/Alt*.astro, grouped by
 * section, in a vertical scroll. Each chart sits in a frame matching the
 * chartbook-unit visual register so the reader can evaluate it in the
 * same surround a production plate would have.
 *
 * The user reads this page, picks the alternatives they want to keep,
 * and the rest get deleted in a follow-up sweep.
 */

